abstract: >-
  LinguaX Arc is a fully offline corpus analysis toolkit for Android. It
  provides KWIC concordancing, concordance plots, collocation and cluster
  analysis, n-grams, word lists, keyness analysis against a reference corpus,
  part-of-speech tagging and lemmatisation, sentiment analysis, readability
  and lexical diversity measures, and corpus cleaning utilities. All processing
  runs on the device, requiring no internet connection and transmitting no
  data, which makes it suitable for fieldwork, low-connectivity settings, and
  sensitive corpora that cannot be uploaded to third-party servers.
